{"root":"duka","ipa":"/duka/","core":"悲伤、忧愁、哀痛，通常指内心深处的痛苦或不幸。","pos":["名词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/duka/","zh":"悲伤、忧愁","phrases":[{"t":"berduka cita","zh":"哀悼"},{"t":"masa duka","zh":"悲伤时期"},{"t":"suka duka","zh":"悲欢离合"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia sangat duka atas kepergian ibunya.","zh":"他因母亲的离世而感到非常悲伤。"},{"t":"Kita harus berbagi suka dan duka bersama.","zh":"我们应该共同分担悲欢离合。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"duka","ipa":"/duka/","zh":"悲伤","phrase":{"t":"wajah duka","zh":"忧伤的面容"},"example":{"t":"Hatinya penuh dengan duka.","zh":"他的内心充满了悲伤。"}},{"w":"berduka","ipa":"/bərduka/","zh":"哀悼、处于悲伤中","phrase":{"t":"keluarga yang berduka","zh":"哀悼中的家庭"},"example":{"t":"Seluruh bangsa sedang berduka atas bencana itu.","zh":"举国上下都在为那场灾难哀悼。"}},{"w":"mendukakan","ipa":"/məndukakan/","zh":"使人悲伤、令人生忧","phrase":{"t":"peristiwa yang mendukakan","zh":"令人悲伤的事件"},"example":{"t":"Kabar itu sangat mendukakan hatinya.","zh":"那个消息让他感到非常难过。"}},{"w":"kedukaan","ipa":"/kədukaan/","zh":"悲伤、忧愁（名词形式）","phrase":{"t":"masa kedukaan","zh":"哀悼期"},"example":{"t":"Dia mencoba menyembunyikan kedukaannya.","zh":"他试图掩饰自己的悲伤。"}}],"derSlugs":["duka","berduka","mendukakan","kedukaan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:33:03.686Z","src":"base"}